<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"cha\">10<br>(0)</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table></section><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\"><table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Saving throws</caption>\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"str\"><b>STR</b></th>\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"dex\"><b>DEX</b></th>\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"con\">CON</th>\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"int\">INT</th>\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"wis\">WIS</th>\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"cha\">CHA</th>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"str\"><b>+3</b></td>\n\t\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"dex\"><b>+5</b></td>\n\t\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"con\">+2</td>\n\t\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"int\">-1</td>\n\t\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"wis\">+2</td>\n\t\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"cha\">0</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table></section><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Features</h2><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"passives\" data-item-name=\"passives\">\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><ul><li><div class=\"bg3wiki-pi-creature-detail\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-pi-creature-detail-title\"><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Martial_Arts:_Bonus_Unarmed_Strike\" title=\"Martial Arts: Bonus Unarmed Strike\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/91/Martial_Arts_Bonus_Unarmed_Strike_Icon.webp/25px-Martial_Arts_Bonus_Unarmed_Strike_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/91/Martial_Arts_Bonus_Unarmed_Strike_Icon.webp/38px-Martial_Arts_Bonus_Unarmed_Strike_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/91/Martial_Arts_Bonus_Unarmed_Strike_Icon.webp/50px-Martial_Arts_Bonus_Unarmed_Strike_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Martial Arts: Bonus Unarmed Strike\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/91/Martial_Arts_Bonus_Unarmed_Strike_Icon.webp/25px-Martial_Arts_Bonus_Unarmed_Strike_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/91/Martial_Arts_Bonus_Unarmed_Strike_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Martial_Arts:_Bonus_Unarmed_Strike\" title=\"Martial Arts: Bonus Unarmed Strike\"><b>Martial Arts: Bonus Unarmed Strike</b></a></span></p></div><div class=\"bg3wiki-pi-creature-detail-text\"><p>After making an attack with a melee <a href=\"/wiki/Monk_weapon\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Monk weapon\">Monk weapon</a> or while unarmed, you can make another unarmed attack as a bonus action.</p></div></div></li><li><div class=\"bg3wiki-pi-creature-detail\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-pi-creature-detail-title\"><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Martial_Arts:_Deft_Strikes\" title=\"Martial Arts: Deft Strikes\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/17/Martial_Arts_Deft_Strikes_Icon.webp/25px-Martial_Arts_Deft_Strikes_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/17/Martial_Arts_Deft_Strikes_Icon.webp/38px-Martial_Arts_Deft_Strikes_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/17/Martial_Arts_Deft_Strikes_Icon.webp/50px-Martial_Arts_Deft_Strikes_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Martial Arts: Deft Strikes\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/17/Martial_Arts_Deft_Strikes_Icon.webp/25px-Martial_Arts_Deft_Strikes_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/17/Martial_Arts_Deft_Strikes_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Martial_Arts:_Deft_Strikes\" title=\"Martial Arts: Deft Strikes\"><b>Martial Arts: Deft Strikes</b></a></span></p></div><div class=\"bg3wiki-pi-creature-detail-text\"><p>Attacks with Monk Weapons and unarmed attacks deal <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-bludgeoning\">1d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bludgeoning\" title=\"Bludgeoning\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bludgeoning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Bludgeoning\" title=\"Bludgeoning\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-bludgeoning\">Bludgeoning</span></a> damage, unless their normal damage is higher.</p></div></div></li><li><div class=\"bg3wiki-pi-creature-detail\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-pi-creature-detail-title\"><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Martial_Arts:_Dextrous_Attacks\" title=\"Martial Arts: Dextrous Attacks\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/de/Martial_Arts_Dextrous_Attacks_Icon.webp/25px-Martial_Arts_Dextrous_Attacks_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/de/Martial_Arts_Dextrous_Attacks_Icon.webp/38px-Martial_Arts_Dextrous_Attacks_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/de/Martial_Arts_Dextrous_Attacks_Icon.webp/50px-Martial_Arts_Dextrous_Attacks_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Martial Arts: Dextrous Attacks\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/de/Martial_Arts_Dextrous_Attacks_Icon.webp/25px-Martial_Arts_Dextrous_Attacks_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/de/Martial_Arts_Dextrous_Attacks_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Martial_Arts:_Dextrous_Attacks\" title=\"Martial Arts: Dextrous Attacks\"><b>Martial Arts: Dextrous Attacks</b></a></span></p></div><div class=\"bg3wiki-pi-creature-detail-text\"><p>Attacks with <a href=\"/wiki/Monk#Monk_weapons\" title=\"Monk\">Monk weapons</a> and unarmed attacks scale with your Dexterity instead of your Strength if your Dexterity is higher.</p></div></div></li><li><div class=\"bg3wiki-pi-creature-detail\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-pi-creature-detail-title\"><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Martial_Prodigy\" title=\"Martial Prodigy\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/20/Martial_Prodigy_Icon.webp/25px-Martial_Prodigy_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/20/Martial_Prodigy_Icon.webp/38px-Martial_Prodigy_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/20/Martial_Prodigy_Icon.webp/50px-Martial_Prodigy_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Martial Prodigy\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/20/Martial_Prodigy_Icon.webp/25px-Martial_Prodigy_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/20/Martial_Prodigy_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Martial_Prodigy\" title=\"Martial Prodigy\"><b>Martial Prodigy</b></a></span></p></div><div class=\"bg3wiki-pi-creature-detail-text\"><p>Gain proficiency in <a href=\"/wiki/Light_Armour\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Light Armour\">Light Armour</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Medium_Armour\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Medium Armour\">Medium Armour</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Shortswords\" title=\"Shortswords\">Shortswords</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Longswords\" title=\"Longswords\">Longswords</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Greatswords\" title=\"Greatswords\">Greatswords</a>.</p></div></div></li><li><div class=\"bg3wiki-pi-creature-detail\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-pi-creature-detail-title\"><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Opportunity_Attack\" title=\"Opportunity Attack\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/35/Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp/25px-Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/35/Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp/38px-Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/35/Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp/50px-Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Opportunity Attack\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/35/Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp/25px-Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/35/Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Opportunity_Attack\" title=\"Opportunity Attack\"><b>Opportunity Attack</b></a></span></p></div><div class=\"bg3wiki-pi-creature-detail-text\"><p>Attack an enemy moving out of reach.</p></div></div></li><li><div class=\"bg3wiki-pi-creature-detail\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-pi-creature-detail-title\"><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Unarmoured_Defence_(Monk)\" title=\"Unarmoured Defence (Monk)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7c/Unarmoured_Defence_Monk_Icon.webp/25px-Unarmoured_Defence_Monk_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7c/Unarmoured_Defence_Monk_Icon.webp/38px-Unarmoured_Defence_Monk_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7c/Unarmoured_Defence_Monk_Icon.webp/50px-Unarmoured_Defence_Monk_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Unarmoured Defence\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7c/Unarmoured_Defence_Monk_Icon.webp/25px-Unarmoured_Defence_Monk_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7c/Unarmoured_Defence_Monk_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Unarmoured_Defence_(Monk)\" title=\"Unarmoured Defence (Monk)\"><b>Unarmoured Defence</b></a></span></p></div><div class=\"bg3wiki-pi-creature-detail-text\"><p>Your reflexes are as effective as any <a href=\"/wiki/Armour\" title=\"Armour\">armour</a>. While not wearing armour, you add your <a href=\"/wiki/Wisdom#Wisdom_Modifier_Chart\" title=\"Wisdom\">Wisdom Modifier</a> to your <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/38px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Armour Class\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\">Armour Class</a>.</p></div></div></li></ul></div>\n</div></section></section>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color pi-collapse pi-collapse-closed\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Technical</h2><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"uid\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-label\">UID</div></h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-data\"><code>S_GLO_Hirelings_Monk</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_GLO_Hirelings_Monk+type:localcharacter%2Cglobalcharacter%2Ccharactertemplate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_GLO_Hirelings_Monk+type:localcharacter%2Cglobalcharacter%2Ccharactertemplate\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div></div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"uuid\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-label\">UUID</div></h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-data\"><code>0b149cab-4438-467a-953d-8697535b953d</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:0b149cab-4438-467a-953d-8697535b953d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:0b149cab-4438-467a-953d-8697535b953d\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div></div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"stats\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-label\">Stats</div></h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-data\"><code>HeroGithFemale</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:HeroGithFemale+type:statscharacter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:HeroGithFemale+type:statscharacter\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div></div>\n</div><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color pi-collapse pi-collapse-open\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Variant 1</h2><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"uid2\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-label\">UID</div></h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-data\"><code>Hirelings_Stats_Player_Monk</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Hirelings_Stats_Player_Monk+type:localcharacter%2Cglobalcharacter%2Ccharactertemplate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Hirelings_Stats_Player_Monk+type:localcharacter%2Cglobalcharacter%2Ccharactertemplate\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div></div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"uuid2\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-label\">UUID</div></h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-data\"><code>481bdfb0-104b-4f30-9ec0-dbc09d8bc502</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:481bdfb0-104b-4f30-9ec0-dbc09d8bc502\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:481bdfb0-104b-4f30-9ec0-dbc09d8bc502\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div></div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"stats2\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-label\">Stats</div></h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-data\"><code>HeroGithFemale</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:HeroGithFemale+type:statscharacter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:HeroGithFemale+type:statscharacter\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div></div>\n</div></section></section></aside>\n<b>Sina'zith</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Githyanki\" title=\"Githyanki\">Githyanki</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Monk\" title=\"Monk\">Monk</a>. As a <a href=\"/wiki/Hirelings\" title=\"Hirelings\">hireling</a>, she can be recruited at camp and respecced at any time.\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Backstory\">Backstory</span></h2>\n<p>Sina'zith's monastic preferences marked her a misfit among her kin - as did the illithid tadpole an Absolutist forced in her mind. For this, the githyanki slew her as an aberration.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Achievements\">Achievements</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-achievement\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; width: 100%; min-width: 10em; max-width: 45em; align-items: center; padding: 0 1em;\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-achievement\" style=\"max-width: 80px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Achievements\" title=\"Achievements\"><picture><img src=\"/w/images/d/d5/A-Outsourcing.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d5/A-Outsourcing.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-achievement\" style=\"margin: 0 auto 0 0; padding: 0 0.8em; text-align:left;\">\n<dl><dt>Outsourcing</dt>\n<dd>Recruit a hireling. You can befriend them or use them as cannon-fodder - we won't judge.</dd></dl>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"navbox-styles\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r138587\">.mw-parser-output .hlist dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist ul,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dl,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist ul{margin:0;padding:0}.mw-parser-output .hlist dl ul,.mw-parser-output .hlist dl dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist ul dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist ul ul,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dl ul,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dl dl,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist ul dl,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist ul ul{display:inline}.mw-parser-output .hlist dd,.mw-parser-output .hlist dt,.mw-parser-output .hlist li,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dd,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki